OL,3,GNEWSAHidden structure may solve
OL,4,Ayears-old mystery
OL,5,
OL,6,FArchaeologists who returned to a site
OL,7,Fthat had puzzled them for years after
OL,8,Funcovering substantial walls buried
OL,9,Fbeneath a field, have found fresh
OL,10,Fevidence about what once stood there.
OL,12,FThe structure, in Dorset on the edge of
OL,13,FPoole Harbour, was first identified by
OL,14,FBournemouth University during a student
OL,15,Ftraining excavation in 2018, but its
OL,16,Fage and purpose remained unknown.
OL,18,FSeven years later, a team of
OL,19,Fspecialists believes it has confirmed
OL,20,Fthe location of a medieval farmstead
OL,21,Fthought to have been recorded on a
OL,22,Flocal map dating from the 15th Century.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
